        <activityName xml:lang="en">Kitchen worktop, natural stone, granite, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Kitchen worktop, natural stone, granite, at plant
na;
UUID: 8f029da8-263a-338a-a899-883782aa4bf8
This data set includes the materials and resources needed for producing natural stone kitchen countertops per m2. The worktop has a thickness of 30 mm. An average kitchen countertop has the measures of 2400 mm x 600 mm (1.44 m2). The sink is not included. Transport is estimated according to the ecoinvent standard distances for Switzerland.; Geography: Data valid for Switzerland
Location: Data valid for Switzerland
Technology: Average production
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: unknown 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_8f029da8-263a-338a-a899-883782aa4bf8.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
